{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38426","headline":"和韩致光侍郎无题三首十四韵 一 · 吴融","name":"和韩致光侍郎无题三首十四韵 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠佩元消暑，犀簪自辟尘。\n揜灯容燕宿，开镜待鸡晨。\n去嬾都忘旧，来多未厌新。\n每逢忧是梦，长忆故延真。\n杏小双圆压，山浓两点嚬。\n瘦难胜宝带，轻欲驭飙轮。\n箆凤金雕翼，钗鱼玉镂鳞。\n月明无睡夜，花落断肠春。\n解舞何须楚，能筝可在秦。\n怯探同海底，稀遇极天津。\n绿柰攀宫艳，青梅弄岭珍。\n管纤银字咽，梭密锦书匀。\n厌胜还随俗，无疑不避人。\n可怜三五夕，娬媚善爲邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}